    {
      "description": "Search the state business-registration records by counts and fields rather than by one name: addresses by how many businesses are registered there, people by how many businesses they govern or are agent for, businesses by agent, governor, address and formation date. Returns the structured search the question was read as (check its summary) and the matching records, whose labels open in Context. Counts cover only the records Context holds; result.corpus says how many.",
